{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"apps/clax_app/macos/Runner/Configs/AppInfo.xcconfig","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-13T05:10:58.754344Z","id":"f7d8d15ec21e675f9126979fc0f774aeb83f940a1241429eaa1c7da9fae89950","body":{"detail":"Verified with no certificate: without macos/Signing.xcconfig, 'just app-macos' (f1c07f346b12) builds; codesign -dv shows Signature=adhoc for clax_app.app and Contents/Resources/clax (sandbox + inherit entitlements), and codesign --verify --deep --strict passes. With a placeholder Signing.xcconfig, xcodebuild -showBuildSettings resolves CODE_SIGN_IDENTITY = Apple Development and DEVELOPMENT_TEAM for Debug, Release and Profile (an include from the project-level Debug.xcconfig instead leaves CODE_SIGN_IDENTITY = -). Not verified: a real signed build. Steps once a certificate exists: (1) security find-certificate -c 'Apple Development' -p | openssl x509 -noout -subject, take OU as the team ID; (2) sed 's/XXXXXXXXXX/<team>/' apps/clax_app/macos/Signing.xcconfig.example > apps/clax_app/macos/Signing.xcconfig; (3) just app-macos. If xcodebuild fails with 'No profiles for dev.empathic.clax' (CODE_SIGN_STYLE is Automatic at target level, so Signing.xcconfig cannot switch it), open apps/clax_app/macos/Runner.xcworkspace in Xcode once, pick the team on the Runner target's Signing & Capabilities, build, then revert any project.pbxproj change and rerun just app-macos. (4) codesign -dv on build/macos/Build/Products/Release/clax_app.app and its Contents/Resources/clax: both show Authority=Apple Development and the same TeamIdentifier; codesign -d --entitlements - on clax lists only app-sandbox and inherit. (5) Launch: the daemon starts (a sandboxed helper whose signature does not match crashes at launch; Settings shows the daemon up). (6) The keychain asks once (the old item lists the ad-hoc build): Always Allow. Rebuild with just app-macos, relaunch: no prompt.","kind":"concern","span":{"start":{"line":16},"end":{"line":23},"content_hash":"907329260faa7a054fced53aa9ba8e6ebe0109483600a5f8c26e007aa9e3bcb8"},"summary":"The team-signed macOS build is untested: no Apple Development certificate was on this Mac","tags":["status:needs-verification","session:claude-code:e697d918-f48a-41f9-aac4-4be74128e8ae"]}}
{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"apps/clax_app/macos/Runner/Configs/AppInfo.xcconfig","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-19T07:31:00.126581Z","id":"2d547b87e94a732af7207ced1f7c9d79893ae27386aee0f8fa7f69c127a6b5f7","body":{"detail":"§4.1/§5.11 of docs/superpowers/specs/2026-10-18-professional-ui-design.md (line 427) gives 'Copyright © 2026 Empathic. All rights reserved.'; f1c07f346b12 chose LICENSE's wording with '(C)', and tool/macos-app-check.sh:22 pins it. §7.1 asks for typographic characters in all UI text.","kind":"concern","span":{"start":{"line":16},"end":{"line":16},"content_hash":"66ce6041b3b91542189b0989323d6bab575e62be2dd55d89ba27986ac9d61f40"},"suggested_fix":"Use '©' in PRODUCT_COPYRIGHT and the check (xcconfig files are UTF-8), keeping LICENSE's 'Empathic, Inc.' if that is the owner's choice.","summary":"About Clax reads “Copyright (C) 2026 Empathic, Inc.”: a straight “(C)” where the app's copy is curly, and not the spec's line","tags":["review","copy","phase-2","session:claude-code:e697d918-f48a-41f9-aac4-4be74128e8ae"]}}
{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"apps/clax_app/macos/Runner/Configs/AppInfo.xcconfig","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-19T07:46:02.635538Z","id":"bfcf5daa814570bdfdb3863200c3262fbdc3572b96e44137b914b0dabf962a10","body":{"kind":"resolve","ref":"git:f1c07f346b12","summary":"Fixed: PRODUCT_COPYRIGHT = Copyright © 2026 Empathic, Inc. bazelisk test //apps/clax_app:macos_app_test passes ('PASS: copyright'); with only the check changed it failed with 'FAIL: copyright: Copyright (C) 2026 Empathic, Inc.'","supersedes":"2d547b87e94a732af7207ced1f7c9d79893ae27386aee0f8fa7f69c127a6b5f7","tags":["reason:fixed","session:claude-code:e697d918-f48a-41f9-aac4-4be74128e8ae"]}}
{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"apps/clax_app/macos/Runner/Configs/AppInfo.xcconfig","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-29T18:31:12.090490Z","id":"af4bb25e330068b755be8dab5fa991e13e05b76009f99f24cefba89d3e16213d","body":{"detail":"Verified with no certificate: without macos/Signing.xcconfig, 'just app-macos' (f1c07f346b12) builds; codesign -dv shows Signature=adhoc for clax_app.app and Contents/Resources/clax (sandbox + inherit entitlements), and codesign --verify --deep --strict passes. With a placeholder Signing.xcconfig, xcodebuild -showBuildSettings resolves CODE_SIGN_IDENTITY = Apple Development and DEVELOPMENT_TEAM for Debug, Release and Profile (an include from the project-level Debug.xcconfig instead leaves CODE_SIGN_IDENTITY = -). Not verified: a real signed build. Steps once a certificate exists: (1) security find-certificate -c 'Apple Development' -p | openssl x509 -noout -subject, take OU as the team ID; (2) sed 's/XXXXXXXXXX/<team>/' apps/clax_app/macos/Signing.xcconfig.example > apps/clax_app/macos/Signing.xcconfig; (3) just app-macos. If xcodebuild fails with 'No profiles for dev.empathic.clax' (CODE_SIGN_STYLE is Automatic at target level, so Signing.xcconfig cannot switch it), open apps/clax_app/macos/Runner.xcworkspace in Xcode once, pick the team on the Runner target's Signing & Capabilities, build, then revert any project.pbxproj change and rerun just app-macos. (4) codesign -dv on build/macos/Build/Products/Release/clax_app.app and its Contents/Resources/clax: both show Authority=Apple Development and the same TeamIdentifier; codesign -d --entitlements - on clax lists only app-sandbox and inherit. (5) Launch: the daemon starts (a sandboxed helper whose signature does not match crashes at launch; Settings shows the daemon up). (6) The keychain asks once (the old item lists the ad-hoc build): Always Allow. Rebuild with just app-macos, relaunch: no prompt.\nRe-anchored unchanged from mailto:alex@kesling.co (session:claude-code:e697d918-f48a-41f9-aac4-4be74128e8ae)'s record.","kind":"concern","span":{"start":{"line":18},"end":{"line":25},"content_hash":"907329260faa7a054fced53aa9ba8e6ebe0109483600a5f8c26e007aa9e3bcb8"},"summary":"The team-signed macOS build is untested: no Apple Development certificate was on this Mac","supersedes":"f7d8d15ec21e675f9126979fc0f774aeb83f940a1241429eaa1c7da9fae89950","tags":["status:needs-verification","session:claude-code:985c579c-9fcb-4f5b-b70f-deedb4f3ea58"]}}
